<title>USA: National Fuel names new exploration chief.</title>
<headline>National Fuel names new exploration chief.</headline>
<dateline>BUFFALO, N.Y. 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Fuel Gas Co said Wednesday James A. Beck has been elected president of Seneca Resources Corp, its Houston-based natural gas and oil exploration and production subsidiary.</p>
<p>He was executive vice president.</p>
<p>Beck replaces Philip C. Ackerman who is also President of National Fuel's utility and senior vice president of National Fuel Gas, the company said. -- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
